A WebGL uniform location in Ladybird belongs to one link of its program,
and a location from before a later link, successful or not, generates
INVALID_OPERATION. Blink’s WebGLUniformLocation compares the link count
it was made with to its program’s LinkCount(), WebKit’s compares it to
its program’s getLinkCount(), and Gecko ties each location to the link
result of its program (as its mParent). And the test’s output is the
same, line for line, in Chrome 158, Firefox 151, and WebKit 26.5.
